{
 "title": "Sector returns vs lagged rates (distributed lag OLS, HAC)",
 "description": "Equal-weighted monthly return of US financials (mvp_us) on the current and 3 lagged monthly changes in the 10Y Treasury yield and the 10Y-2Y slope. Newey-West HAC errors, joint F-tests per lag block and long-run multipliers.",
 "tags": [
